@startuml
title Login flow
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor User
box "Backend" #LightBlue
participant "Web Server" as Web
database DB
end box
autonumber
User -> Web ++ : POST /login
Web -> DB : SELECT user
DB --> Web : row
alt valid password
  Web --> User : 302 /home
else invalid
  Web -[#red]>x User : 401
end
note right of DB
  passwords are
  hashed
end note
== Session ==
group Refresh
  User ->> Web : ping
end
ref over User, Web : Logout
return done
@enduml
